<title>USA: Philadelphia approves $121.9 mln bond referendum.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia approves $121.9 mln bond referendum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia voters on Tuesday approved a bond question authorizing $121.9 of bonds for capital improvements, a city official said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The preliminary count was 30,056 to 13,848, the election official said.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
